      {
       "type": "text",
       "text": "I entered the order as written (Order ID ORD-0001): sertraline 400 mg by mouth, once daily.\n\nI added a note to the order. It says the dose is above the 200 mg/day labeled maximum and needs attending and pharmacy verification before it's given.\n\nPlease make sure your attending knows about this order. If pharmacy questions it, they may call or message you. Watch the patient closely for serotonin syndrome, which can cause agitation, tremor, sweating, fever, diarrhea, and clonus. Also watch for QT prolongation, and consider getting an ECG."
      }
     ],
